{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "46d2954e-055c-87a5-8e1b-c8bb0de04aca",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T13:38:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yeah. Well, I hope I'm calling the right office. It's about the water and sewer bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, so nothing's wrong, exactly. I just, well, I don't understand how it's figured. I'm at 178 Ayrault Street. The account's still in my wife's name, she passed, and I never changed it. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine for talking about the bill. I'm sorry for your loss. What would you like to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Um, well, I'm trying to make a budget, and I'd like a breakdown of the usage by month. I don't want anything changed, I just want it explained. The bill says, um, consumption units, and I don't know what a unit is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A unit is usually one hundred cubic feet of water, which is about seven hundred fifty gallons. Sewer is charged based on the water you use. I can look up the account and read you the past months."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the unit is, um, seven fifty gallons? And the sewer is the same number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it follows your water use. Give me a second to pull it up. [pause] Okay, I can see the billing history. Do you want me to read it off, or mail you a printout?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, maybe read it, and then mail it? Is it monthly or, um, quarterly? Because I thought monthly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question, it's billed quarterly, so I'll go through each bill and explain it."
    }
  ],
